| Feature        | Before v0.2.0                       | After v0.2.0                      |
|----------------|-------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|
| validate fn    | `validate(attrs, context)`          | `validate(attrs)`                 |
| variables      | Accessible in validate & elsewhere  | **Not** in validate; only in render, etc. |

